{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>His sons will seek the favor of the poor</b> — The interpretation is correct, that it is from the root רצון, and how will he seek favor, for his sons will be forced to seek favor from the poor whom he robbed. And furthermore it is possible that <b>his hands will restore his wealth</b> (Job 20:10) — אונו like הונו, as in מצאתי און לי, and אמון like המון."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:07.055409516Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}